#: docs/guides/backfill.md
msgid "Backfill patterns"
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/backfill.md
msgid "This guide shows you how to load history, reprocess data after a logic change, fill gaps after an outage, and bring in a source that has years of history, without creating duplicates, losing data or harming production. These patterns serve the contract in [CAP-BACKFILL]{1}, and section 8 shows which invariants prove each of its clauses."
msgstr ""

