#: docs/guides/backfill.md
msgid "**Determinism.** Running `B` with the same inputs and logic version on two occasions produces identical outputs (per-slice hash equality)."
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/backfill.md
msgid "**Scope.** `B` modifies no row outside `R` (snapshot diff of the commit touches only files/rows in `R`; per-slice hashes outside `R` unchanged)."
