msgid "**Time zone.** Per-day counts in source and target agree when both are bucketed in UTC."
msgstr ""

#: docs/guides/backfill.md
msgid "**Restatement record.** If `B` changed any previously published value, the restatement log has an entry with slices, reason, old and new totals, and logic versions."
